{"4878220":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"DashBreaker","steam_appid":4878220,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From small asteroids to massive warships<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DashBreaker is an active incremental game where you dash through enemies and spend the resources you collect on permanent ship upgrades. Head out in a small craft, gather resources, unlock new abilities, and break through ever larger foes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/extras\/dc84bd6cc37268843220ef648dc48208.poster.avif?t=1793642669\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/extras\/dc84bd6cc37268843220ef648dc48208.webm?t=1793642669\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/extras\/dc84bd6cc37268843220ef648dc48208.mp4?t=1793642669\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From single targets to sweeping destruction<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, breaking a single asteroid takes your full attention. As your upgrades add up, you can pierce tougher enemies, spread your attacks to nearby targets, and bring down whole groups at once. The same single dash delivers a completely different result.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/extras\/d442db7e7f2faa039e0b8a25377dabad.poster.avif?t=1793642669\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/extras\/d442db7e7f2faa039e0b8a25377dabad.webm?t=1793642669\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/extras\/d442db7e7f2faa039e0b8a25377dabad.mp4?t=1793642669\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather more. Come back stronger.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The resources you bring back from each sortie fuel your next upgrades. Return to base to boost your attack power, widen your collection range, and keep your craft fighting longer. The more enemies you destroy and resources you gather, the closer you get to the next ability you want to unlock.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/extras\/c6f65f54508bb78a83f7092eb1dd969b.poster.avif?t=1793642669\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/extras\/c6f65f54508bb78a83f7092eb1dd969b.webm?t=1793642669\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/extras\/c6f65f54508bb78a83f7092eb1dd969b.mp4?t=1793642669\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Break through the battles that once held you back<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start in a mining zone dotted with small asteroids, then advance into battlefields defended by missiles and massive warships. Enemies you once struggled to break through become new proof of your growing strength. Carve through enemy groups with stronger dashes and take on bigger targets.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/extras\/ea6a25cbb1f4a06295542b09cf2030e5.poster.avif?t=1793642669\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/extras\/ea6a25cbb1f4a06295542b09cf2030e5.webm?t=1793642669\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/extras\/ea6a25cbb1f4a06295542b09cf2030e5.mp4?t=1793642669\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From small asteroids to massive warships<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DashBreaker is an active incremental game where you dash through enemies and spend the resources you collect on permanent ship upgrades. Head out in a small craft, gather resources, unlock new abilities, and break through ever larger foes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/extras\/dc84bd6cc37268843220ef648dc48208.poster.avif?t=1793642669\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/extras\/dc84bd6cc37268843220ef648dc48208.webm?t=1793642669\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/extras\/dc84bd6cc37268843220ef648dc48208.mp4?t=1793642669\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From single targets to sweeping destruction<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, breaking a single asteroid takes your full attention. As your upgrades add up, you can pierce tougher enemies, spread your attacks to nearby targets, and bring down whole groups at once. The same single dash delivers a completely different result.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/extras\/d442db7e7f2faa039e0b8a25377dabad.poster.avif?t=1793642669\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/extras\/d442db7e7f2faa039e0b8a25377dabad.webm?t=1793642669\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/extras\/d442db7e7f2faa039e0b8a25377dabad.mp4?t=1793642669\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather more. Come back stronger.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The resources you bring back from each sortie fuel your next upgrades. Return to base to boost your attack power, widen your collection range, and keep your craft fighting longer. The more enemies you destroy and resources you gather, the closer you get to the next ability you want to unlock.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/extras\/c6f65f54508bb78a83f7092eb1dd969b.poster.avif?t=1793642669\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/extras\/c6f65f54508bb78a83f7092eb1dd969b.webm?t=1793642669\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/extras\/c6f65f54508bb78a83f7092eb1dd969b.mp4?t=1793642669\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Break through the battles that once held you back<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start in a mining zone dotted with small asteroids, then advance into battlefields defended by missiles and massive warships. Enemies you once struggled to break through become new proof of your growing strength. Carve through enemy groups with stronger dashes and take on bigger targets.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/extras\/ea6a25cbb1f4a06295542b09cf2030e5.poster.avif?t=1793642669\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/extras\/ea6a25cbb1f4a06295542b09cf2030e5.webm?t=1793642669\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/extras\/ea6a25cbb1f4a06295542b09cf2030e5.mp4?t=1793642669\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"From breaking asteroids to piercing massive warships, grow your small craft into a force to be reckoned with. DashBreaker is an active incremental game: dash through enemies, gather resources, and buy permanent upgrades. Unlock new abilities and wipe out more enemies with every dash.","supported_languages":"English, Korean, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Finnish, Indonesian, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/fe60fa057e7b358018fac3bf7fc260f75737d188\/header.jpg?t=1793642669","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/524901da29b4f552c041244158cd0b4c8bbab998\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793642669","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4878220\/524901da29b4f552c041244158cd0b4c8bbab998\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793642669","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 1.8 GHz dual-core processor<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><str